```
ACCEPT  tcp  eth2→*  src 172.16.10.0/24  dst 172.18.51.1  dpt:80   (0 hits)
DROP    tcp  eth2→*  any→any                                          (0 hits)
DROP    udp  eth2→*  any→any                                          (0 hits)
